---
const title = "Business Improvement Assessment — AI Improved";
const description = "Why an assessment comes before implementation. What we examine and what you receive.";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://aiimproved.io/assessment" />
    <style is:global>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #FAFBFC; color: #0F172A; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
      header, main, footer { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem; }
      a { color: #0F766E; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="/">← AI Improved</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <h1>Business Improvement Assessment</h1>
      <p>An assessment comes before any implementation. We start by understanding the actual constraint in your business, not by recommending tools.</p>
      <h2>What we examine</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Clearly defined processes and their current performance</li>
        <li>Bottlenecks, wasted effort, missed opportunities, and costly errors</li>
        <li>Baseline measurements and an estimated business case for improvement</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What you receive</h2>
      <p>A practical assessment that identifies the problem, prioritizes realistic opportunities, and outlines a recommended next step. No commitment to implement is required.</p>
      <p>The scope and price of the diagnostic are agreed before assessment work begins. Implementation pricing is determined after the assessment. Diagnostic pricing is not published at this time.</p>
      <p><a href="/#contact">Discuss a business improvement</a></p>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
